 damage increases precision damage."},{"name":"All-Star","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/719abc9d2ce56aa4daffd87152d4d97d.png","desc":"Collecting ammo loads this weapon from reserves and enhances its damage and reload speed for a duration.\n\nCollecting Heavy ammo grants more time."},{"name":"Binary Orbit","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/1efa3bc1f9622f08f7d2461f2fb080f9.png","desc":"Elemental final blows opposite this weapon increase damage for a short duration. Darkness final blows boost Arc, Solar, and Void weapons. Light final blows boost Stasis, Strand, and Kinetic weapons."}]}],"modes":{"all":{"rolls":[[4,11,29,39],[8,11,29,36],[2,13,29,41],[4,13,29,38],[8,11,29,39],[8,13,29,38],[8,13,29,41],[2,13,29,38],[4,11,29,36],[4,13,29,37],[8,11,29,37],[8,13,29,37],[4,11,25,36],[4,11,25,39],[4,11,26,37],[4,13,25,36],[4,13,25,39],[4,13,26,37],[4,13,29,36],[4,13,29,39],[4,13,29,41],[6,11,29,41],[6,13,29,41],[8,11,25,36],[8,11,25,39],[8,11,26,37],[8,13,25,36],[8,13,25,39],[8,13,26,37],[8,13,29,36],[8,13,29,39],[8,17,29,38],[8,17,29,41],[2,11,29,37],[2,17,29,38],[2,17,29,41],[4,11,25,37],[4,11,26,36],[4,11,26,39],[4,11,29,37],[4,13,25,37],[4,13,26,36],[4,13,26,39],[5,11,29,37],[6,13,29,38],[8,11,25,37],[8,11,26,36],[8,11,26,39],[8,11,29,41],[8,13,25,37],[8,13,26,36],[8,13,26,39],[2,11,29,39],[2,11,29,41],[2,12,24,38],[2,12,24,41],[2,12,29,38],[2,12,29,41],[2,13,24,38],[2,13,24,41],[2,13,29,37],[4,12,24,38],[4,12,24,41],[4,12,29,38],[4,12,29,41],[4,13,24,38],[4,13,24,41],[4,13,29,40],[4,17,29,38],[4,17,29,41],[5,11,29,39],[6,11,29,36],[6,11,29,37],[6,11,29,38],[6,17,29,38],[6,17,29,41],[7,11,29,38],[7,11,29,41],[7,13,29,38],[7,13,29,41],[7,17,29,38],[7,17,29,41],[8,11,29,38],[8,12,24,38],[8,12,24,41],[8,12,29,38],[8,12,29,41],[8,13,24,38],[8,13,24,41],[8,13,29,40],[2,11,25,38],[2,11,25,41],[2,11,29,36],[2,11,29,38],[2,12,24,37],[2,12,24,40],[2,12,28,37],[2,12,28,38],[2,12,28,40],[2,12,28,41],[2,12,29,37],[2,12,29,40],[2,13,24,37],[2,13,24,40],[2,13,25,38],[2,13,